        "original_id": "ae28b962-d065-5a9f-9760-b310503807e5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ringo Starr\n- Products: Time Takes Time, \"With a Little Help from My Friends\", \"Yellow Submarine\", \"Good Night\", \"Act Naturally\"\n- Topics: studio albums, lead vocals, comeback albums\n\nFacts:\n- Ringo Starr occasionally sang lead vocals for one song on a Beatles album, including \"With a Little Help from My Friends\", \"Yellow Submarine\", \"Good Night\", and the Beatles' cover of \"Act Naturally\".\n- Time Takes Time is Ringo Starr's tenth studio album.\n- Time Takes Time was released in 1992.\n- Time Takes Time was Ringo Starr's critically acclaimed comeback album.",
